    {
      "id": "tang-906",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "双鱼谣",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "贾岛",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "天河堕双鲂，飞我庭中央。\n掌握尺余雪，劈开肠有璜。\n见令馋舌短，烹绕邻舍香。\n一得古诗字，与玉含异藏。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "6549793f38729568cb37809ad41d754aa18c6a3f431ca71d8b797d7d4c956328",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-906--6549793f38729568cb37809ad41d754aa18c6a3f431ca71d8b797d7d4c956328.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-907",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "十二月一日三首",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "今朝腊月春意动，云安县前江可怜。\n一声何处送书雁，百丈谁家上水船。\n未将梅蕊惊愁眼，要取楸花媚远天。\n明光起草人所羡，肺病几时朝日边。\n寒轻市上山烟碧，日满楼前江雾黄。\n负盐出井此溪女，打鼓发船何郡郎。\n新亭举目风景切，茂陵著书消渴长。\n春花不愁不烂漫，楚客唯听棹相将。\n即看燕子入山扉，岂有黄鹂历翠微。\n短短桃花临水岸，轻轻柳絮点人衣。\n春来准拟开怀久，老去亲知见面稀。\n他日一杯难强进，重嗟筋力故山违。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "681d8207b4dd61f1aba1a2c0d3e7a77840ca8dc09b918d58bee32977a85bb67f",
      "estimatedOutput": 1006,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-907--681d8207b4dd61f1aba1a2c0d3e7a77840ca8dc09b918d58bee32977a85bb67f.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-908",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "五贶诗。华顶杖",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "皮日休",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "金庭仙树枝，道客自携持。\n探洞求丹粟，挑云觅白芝。\n量泉将濯足，阑鹤把支颐。\n以此将为赠，惟君尽得知。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "c482518b91ce11a14b30bfac7a18195be4940e73195331f3500302d0b94ddec2",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-908--c482518b91ce11a14b30bfac7a18195be4940e73195331f3500302d0b94ddec2.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-909",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "漫书五首 其二",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "司空图",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "溪边随事有桑麻，尽日山程十数家。\n莫怪行人频怅望，杜鹃不是故乡花。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "00025d9ed6a0efe34ba85b044f9dbe7855e023b2fb897036ebaf9fee2aa28b5e",
      "estimatedOutput": 666,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-909--00025d9ed6a0efe34ba85b044f9dbe7855e023b2fb897036ebaf9fee2aa28b5e.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-910",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "同乐天和微之深春二十首 其八",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "刘禹锡",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "何处深春好，春深刺史家。\n夜阑犹命乐，雨甚亦寻花。\n傲客多凭酒，新姬苦上车。\n公门吏散后，风摆戟衣斜。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "b50997e154b7ab193fb39a434c70cc163f821aac1e2d63bd1c03e0f848cb151b",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-910--b50997e154b7ab193fb39a434c70cc163f821aac1e2d63bd1c03e0f848cb151b.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-911",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "守岁侍宴应制",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "杜审言",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "季冬除夜接新年，帝子王孙捧御筵。\n宫阙星河低拂树，殿廷灯烛上薰天。\n弹弦奏节梅风入，对局探钩柏酒传。\n欲向正元歌万寿，暂留欢赏寄春前。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "d4b94e5ebadf96f43dac9a9a591359467ac3e1a1cfa471d30fe160398939e962",
      "estimatedOutput": 734,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-911--d4b94e5ebadf96f43dac9a9a591359467ac3e1a1cfa471d30fe160398939e962.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-912",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "过客相寻",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "穷老真无事，江山已定居。\n地幽忘盥栉，客至罢琴书。\n挂壁移筐果，呼儿问煮鱼。\n时闻系舟楫，及此问吾庐。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "a592464d6952eecbd7d25c9d720724d240733f8e7c5f18cffc38d83c1f042a7e",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
