    {
      "id": "tang-914",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "奉同曾郎中题石瓮寺得嵌韵",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王建",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "寺门连内绕丹岩，下界云开数过帆。\n遥指上皇翻曲处，百官题字满西嵌。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "b16288dc02eb8e6a2d9b74e4c888b0e1a2a89eeb3396b0d5248cd3ecf2f75199",
